@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D97706
title Cost(G) grade to host funding: separate checked authorities

participant "Guest GSLT\nDovetail matcher" as Guest #DBEAFE
participant "Installed image\n+ V2 selector" as Install #EDE9FE
participant "Guest-to-host\nprojection matcher" as Projection #DCFCE7
participant "Trusted Rholang\ncost carrier" as Codec #CFFAFE
participant "Host OSLF\nresource logic" as Host #FCE7F3
participant "Authenticated\noffered-funded supply" as Supply #FEE2E2

Guest -> Install: successor + grade root + exact key\n(same rule and substitution)
Install -> Install: check base / projected prefix,\ncost image, codec, selector
Install -> Projection: selected GuestToHost relation\nchecked grade root
Projection --> Install: all checked typed candidates\nwith exact input/proof commitments
loop every enabled candidate
  Install -> Codec: exact typed host value
  Codec -> Host: canonical Par
  Host -> Host: compute and verify demand bound
  Host -> Supply: compare each signature lane
  Supply --> Host: authenticated supply verdict
end
Host --> Install: funded only if all required checks pass
note over Guest,Supply
  Grade and semantic work are never host purse authority.
  Ambiguity is retained; no first/cheapest candidate is selected.
end note
@enduml
